TI  - Can Continual Pretraining Bridge the Performance Gap between General-purpose and Specialized Language Models in the Medical Domain?
AU  - Doll, Niclas
AU  - Buschhoff, Jasper Schulze
AU  - Satheesh, Shalaka
AU  - Abdelwahab, Hammam
AU  - Allende-Cid, Héctor
