TI  - LePREC: Reasoning as Classification over Structured Factors for Assessing Relevance of Legal Issues
AU  - Wang, Fanyu
AU  - Kang, Xiaoxi
AU  - Burgess, Paul
AU  - Srivastava, Aashish
AU  - Arora, Chetan
AU  - Trakic, Adnan
