TI  - ReProbe: Efficient Test-Time Scaling of Multi-Step Reasoning by Probing Internal States of Large Language Models
AU  - Ni, Jingwei
AU  - Fadeeva, Ekaterina
AU  - Wu, Tianyi
AU  - Akhtar, Mubashara
AU  - Zhang, Jiaheng
AU  - Ash, Elliott
