TI  - Your Reasoning Model is Secretly a Reward Model - Optimization-Free Verification from Experience
AU  - Liang, Zhenwen
AU  - Li, Ruosen
AU  - Zhou, Yujun
AU  - Song, Linfeng
AU  - Yu, Dian
AU  - Du, Xinya
AU  - Mi, Haitao
