TI  - Why Are We Moral? An LLM-based Agent Simulation Approach to the Study of Moral Evolution
AU  - Ziheng, Zhou
AU  - Tang, Huacong
AU  - Bi, Mingjie
AU  - He, Wanying
AU  - Sun, Fang
AU  - Sun, Yizhou
AU  - Wu, Ying Nian
