TI  - JurisBench: A Deep Benchmark for Assessing Large Language Models in Professional Legal Practice
AU  - Chen, Ziang
AU  - Li, Guannan
AU  - Ji, Fanlin
AU  - Kang, Yipeng
AU  - Li, Jiaqi
AU  - Zhang, Muhan
AU  - Zhang, Yangtao
