TI  - LegalGraphRAG: Multi-Agent Graph Retrieval-Augmented Generation for Reliable Legal Reasoning
AU  - Chen, Zerui
AU  - Zhang, Qinggang
AU  - Xiang, Zhishang
AU  - Wei, Zhimin
AU  - Gao, Linfeng
