TI  - Black-Box Membership Inference Attacks for Video Training Data in Multimodal Large Language Models
AU  - Wang, Jinrui
AU  - Gao, Zhenfeng
AU  - Wang, Wendan
AU  - Wang, Huili
AU  - Qin, Zichen
AU  - Zhu, Linjie
